fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"va/vah265lpenc.html#vah265lpenc:key-int-max","fragment":"\n\tkey-int-max\n\nThe maximal distance between two keyframes. It decides the size of GOP (0: auto-calculate)\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tConstruct\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t0\n\n"});